"Lady Varrow keeps her men at the Keep because an Eidhrin Courtier has been visiting her by night."
"The Courtier offered her the valley's safety in a Bargain whose price she has not yet agreed."
"The Courtier wants whatever came up through Hollow Tarn at midwinter, and knows it came."
"Lady Varrow has a Talent-reading glass from the Spires that shows a Talent, Scope and Depth."
